- discriminant: textSection
  value:
    title: 'Accounting that lives in your Odoo'
    number: '01'
    content: '<p>At Agitech we implement Odoo: accounting, invoicing, purchasing, inventory. To keep the numbers accurate day to day, we work with <a href="https://www.agifid.be/index-en.html">AgiFid, a certified accounting firm and ITAA member</a> dedicated to companies run on Odoo.</p><ul><li>Your accountant works directly in your Odoo: no double entry, no files going back and forth</li><li>VAT, closings and tax prepared as you go, not once a year</li><li>Real-time dashboards and indicators</li><li>Fixed, transparent pricing</li></ul>'
    emphasis: false
- discriminant: textSection
  value:
    title: 'Strong synergy, each with its own craft'
    number: '02'
    content: '<p>Agitech and AgiFid work together every day from shared offices: the teams meet, talk and sort out your issues together.</p><ul><li><strong>Agitech</strong> manages your ERP: Odoo implementation, evolutions, development and support</li><li><strong>AgiFid</strong> keeps your accounts day to day, directly in your Odoo</li><li>No more passing the buck: the integrator and the accounting firm coordinate their teams</li><li>Accounts that stay up to date, closings prepared as you go</li></ul><p>For the accounting side, discover <a href="https://www.agifid.be/index-en.html">AgiFid''s accounting firm offer for Odoo</a>.</p>'
    emphasis: false
- discriminant: textSection
  value:
    title: 'Two distinct entities, independence preserved'
    number: '03'
    content: '<p>Despite this close collaboration, Agitech and AgiFid are two separate companies with different shareholders. AgiFid keeps the independence that is inherent to the accounting profession: as a certified accounting firm and ITAA member, it remains bound by its professional ethics and obligations.</p><p>You get the proximity of coordinated teams, with the perspective and independence you expect from an accountant.</p>'
    emphasis: false
- discriminant: ctaBanner
